@startuml Monolith_Deployment

skinparam nodeStyle rectangle
skinparam databaseStyle cylinder

node "Monolith" as MonolithApp {

  artifact "Web API / Controllers" as WebApi
  artifact "CommandBus" as CommandBus
  artifact "ReservationService" as ReservationService
  artifact "SchedulingService" as SchedulingService
  artifact "Validation Chain\n(FacultyPolicyValidator,\nScheduleConflictValidator)" as Validation
  artifact "EventBus\n(InMemoryEventBus / MqttEventBus)" as EventBus
}

database "Reservations DB" as ReservationsDB
cloud "MQTT Broker" as MqttBroker

WebApi          --> CommandBus       : dispatch commands
CommandBus      --> ReservationService : call use-cases
ReservationService --> Validation    : validate requests
ReservationService --> SchedulingService : check/suggest slots
ReservationService --> ReservationsDB : read/write reservations
ReservationService --> EventBus      : publish domain events
EventBus        --> MqttBroker       : forward events (MQTT mode)

@enduml
